# Testing

Never silently weaken tests. Never delete tests simply to make the build pass.

Gmail and Google OAuth must be mocked in automated tests. Tests must never send a real email.

If a test fails because production code is wrong, fix the production code. If a test is invalid, replace it with a stronger test that still covers the original risk.
